<section data-hf-id="hf-u8cb" id="scene-0" class="clip" data-start="0" data-duration="20.493" data-track-index="0"><div data-hf-id="hf-p1of" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-i2om" class="kicker">The principle</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-7p17" class="title">Members decide. Money follows the rules.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-wmxe" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-ixj8" class="principle"><div data-hf-id="hf-uxor" class="big-line">Managing a community</div><div data-hf-id="hf-08g5" class="big-line violet">isn’t owning its money.</div><p data-hf-id="hf-6o7m" class="support">Separate the responsibilities.</p></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-sotd" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-94ij" class="roles"><div data-hf-id="hf-h7it" class="box role"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-g21k">Managers</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-80rn">Organize the syndicate.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-zlop" class="box role"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-8jkv">Members</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-613d">Make the decisions.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-8yid" class="box role cyanbox"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-uxun">Escrow design</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-63ca">Follow the agreed rules.</p></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-nn5s" class="note">A proposed independent financial system.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-m8xe" class="demo">Illustrative demo</div></div></section>
