<section data-hf-id="hf-5zsi" id="scene-3" class="clip" data-start="63.699" data-duration="22.499" data-track-index="3"><div data-hf-id="hf-gyjp" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-ogmp" class="kicker">03 / Membership</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-peit" class="title">A community chooses its members.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-wz74" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-ycyy" class="application"><div data-hf-id="hf-ngj4" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-h52y">Contribution declaration</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-8xnd">State the amount.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-n283" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-b74u">Preset questions</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-hdo3">Answer the community.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-4181" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-yqxw">Motivation</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-608m">Explain why you want to join.</p></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-9mcp" class="threshold"><strong data-hf-id="hf-vex8">&gt;50%</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-dvmd">Admission approval</span></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-qlqn" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-krut" class="compare"><div data-hf-id="hf-yeow"><span data-hf-id="hf-hx8j" class="eyebrow">ADMISSION</span><strong data-hf-id="hf-7plw">&gt;50%</strong><p data-hf-id="hf-cheb">More than half approve.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-y7yw"><span data-hf-id="hf-n6vi" class="eyebrow">REMOVAL</span><strong data-hf-id="hf-45iy">⅔</strong><p data-hf-id="hf-ms6x">Two thirds ≈ 66.7%.</p></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-1ps6" class="note">Management roles do not replace member decisions.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-8wuo" class="demo">Illustrative demo</div></div></section>
<section data-hf-id="hf-emg7" id="scene-4" class="clip" data-start="86.197" data-duration="18.637" data-track-index="4"><div data-hf-id="hf-jqow" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-i9zt" class="kicker">04 / Reputation</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-kmsg" class="title">Feedback with context.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-u71x" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-e8hy" class="review-targets synced-review"><div data-hf-id="hf-4fj2" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-qd9b">Members</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-lw0p">Participation and conduct.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-4tu3" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-v3o5">Agendas</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-963c">Clarity of the rules.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-5854" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-5d8j">Proposals</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-ly9j">Purpose and quality.</p></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-yhzi" class="review-detail"><div data-hf-id="hf-x3be" class="stars">★ ★ ★ ★ ★</div><div data-hf-id="hf-arx4" class="score">1–5 stars</div><div data-hf-id="hf-e3nt" class="review-text">Written descriptions give the score context.</div></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-rsnq" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-smb5" class="outcome-review"><div data-hf-id="hf-5xkm" class="pill">AFTER THE FUNDING PROCESS</div><h3 data-hf-id="hf-4ae7">Proposals + outcomes</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-4fm9">Review the participation. Explain the outcome.</p><div data-hf-id="hf-bk8h" class="review-text">“Clear purpose. Thoughtful participation.”</div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-a4pb" class="note">A useful history, not an unexplained star score.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-64ph" class="demo">Illustrative demo</div></div></section>
<section data-hf-id="hf-89l6" id="scene-5" class="clip" data-start="104.835" data-duration="23.032" data-track-index="5"><div data-hf-id="hf-jcdv" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-l0nb" class="kicker">05 / Financial model</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-2ehx" class="title">Contribute first. Protect the pool.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-ulcy" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-pmyy" class="escrow-flow"><div data-hf-id="hf-kg21" class="actor">Contributors</div><div data-hf-id="hf-yhhf" class="arrow">→</div><div data-hf-id="hf-fd1m" class="pool"><span data-hf-id="hf-hda5" class="lock">◇</span><strong data-hf-id="hf-wevf">Separate pool</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-vz8j">Prepaid contributions</span></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-xmj9" class="restrictions"><span data-hf-id="hf-gabm" class="pill">Held during the process</span><span data-hf-id="hf-tr7e" class="pill">No member withdrawal</span></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-recp" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-ld91" class="gate"><div data-hf-id="hf-42t3" class="manager-label">Admins + moderators</div><div data-hf-id="hf-eqyc" class="gate-line"></div><div data-hf-id="hf-m7vg" class="gate-label">No independent access or redirection</div><div data-hf-id="hf-0e4u" class="pool"><strong data-hf-id="hf-8lfx">Protected process pool</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-ndhn">Designed financial separation</span></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-bl8x" class="note">Current app: locally run and live deployable</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-9zdh" class="finance">Intended escrow model · Live payments by near t</div></div></section>
<section data-hf-id="hf-04ob" id="scene-6" class="clip" data-start="127.867" data-duration="20.984" data-track-index="6"><div data-hf-id="hf-iy2u" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-0hu2" class="kicker">06 / Proposal screening</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-x810" class="title">From an idea to the ballot.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-uznz" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-pjgl" class="scheme"><span data-hf-id="hf-fnjh" class="pill">SCHEME SUBMISSION</span><h3 data-hf-id="hf-w1c6">Community garden</h3><div data-hf-id="hf-5dzd" class="scheme-fields"><span data-hf-id="hf-s6wi" class="pill">Title</span><span data-hf-id="hf-7ej2" class="pill">Description</span><span data-hf-id="hf-1o0w" class="pill">Requested amount</span><span data-hf-id="hf-vnca" class="pill">Purpose</span></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-udnv" class="proposal-right"><div data-hf-id="hf-oeu0" class="metric">Who proposes?</div><p data-hf-id="hf-6gjk" class="support">Everyone or staff only, as the agenda declares.</p></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-sl9s" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-h1c9" class="screen-funnel"><div data-hf-id="hf-i7xy" class="funnel-label">SUBMITTED SCHEMES</div><div data-hf-id="hf-60zw" class="screen-gate"><strong data-hf-id="hf-fekz">24 hours</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-cril">Member screening window</span></div><div data-hf-id="hf-cz8k" class="screen-gate cyanbox"><strong data-hf-id="hf-4x7j">&gt;50% approval</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-tr9p">Qualifies for selection</span></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-u95i" class="note">Screen first. Elect from the approved schemes.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-6j0i" class="demo">Illustrative demo</div></div></section>
<section data-hf-id="hf-iofm" id="scene-7" class="clip" data-start="148.851" data-duration="23.885" data-track-index="7"><div data-hf-id="hf-ijrt" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-dmt8" class="kicker">07 / Election methods</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-3hvj" class="title">Choose how your collective decides.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-vdz0" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-dd7w" class="method-grid"><div data-hf-id="hf-2fzx" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-9aza">FPTP</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-u6vo">First Past the Post</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-2uay" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-fd02">Ranked Choice</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-4hxa">Preference order</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-38lz" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-f2qn">STV</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-i4f6">Single Transferable Vote</p></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-4jxr" class="support center">The agenda chooses the election method.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-s6yr" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-3g0m" class="ratings"><div data-hf-id="hf-oee1" class="rating-group"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-k5ib">Rating methods</h3><span data-hf-id="hf-he2u" class="pill">Elo</span><span data-hf-id="hf-c5e6" class="pill">Glicko-2</span></div><div data-hf-id="hf-umjx" class="rating-group"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-n9p2">One versus one</h3><span data-hf-id="hf-cd8g" class="pill">Elo comparisons</span><span data-hf-id="hf-fx4n" class="pill">Glicko comparisons</span><p data-hf-id="hf-3v5s" class="muted">No draws</p></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-l3h9" class="note">Each method has its own published calculation rules.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-6xbj" class="demo">Illustrative demo</div></div></section>
<section data-hf-id="hf-hl07" id="scene-8" class="clip" data-start="172.736" data-duration="21.795" data-track-index="8"><div data-hf-id="hf-ez0k" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-jvqb" class="kicker">08 / Weight and privacy</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-yzhw" class="title">A fair ballot. A private process.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-sltt" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-3wq9" class="weight-options"><div data-hf-id="hf-e2ps" class="weight"><strong data-hf-id="hf-vsoh">1 member</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-y7ac">1 vote</span></div><div data-hf-id="hf-q632" class="or">or</div><div data-hf-id="hf-vupk" class="weight"><strong data-hf-id="hf-xkht">Contributions</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-8qfd">Predeclared weights</span></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-5imy" class="support center">A moderator’s title adds no weight.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-n0ze" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-pirk" class="privacy"><div data-hf-id="hf-3asl" class="private-box"><span data-hf-id="hf-6b2p" class="lock">◇</span><h3 data-hf-id="hf-zpq3">Ballots + running results</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-jxcc">Hidden while the election is open</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-y36e" class="arrow">→</div><div data-hf-id="hf-jh9v" class="private-box published"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-tpc4">Election closes</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-8eqp">Calculate and publish the result</p></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-ux0f" class="note">Decision calculation is separate from payment execution.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-7bmk" class="demo">Illustrative demo</div></div></section>
<section data-hf-id="hf-cbbh" id="scene-9" class="clip" data-start="194.531" data-duration="23.053" data-track-index="9"><div data-hf-id="hf-ekpj" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-8ju3" class="kicker">09 / Allocation and rejection</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-htd7" class="title">The result is not the release.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-t04u" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-uawi" class="allocation"><div data-hf-id="hf-xwhs" class="shares"><div data-hf-id="hf-v4mo" class="share a"><strong data-hf-id="hf-84va">50%</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-gtcl">First</span></div><div data-hf-id="hf-604b" class="share b"><strong data-hf-id="hf-wwm4">30%</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-mfbd">Second</span></div><div data-hf-id="hf-220a" class="share c"><strong data-hf-id="hf-intj">20%</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-arki">Third</span></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-n8el" class="allocation-modes"><span data-hf-id="hf-xtc0" class="pill">Winner takes all</span><span data-hf-id="hf-a0g3" class="pill">Proportional</span><span data-hf-id="hf-xyt2" class="pill">Custom ranked shares</span></div></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-mmod" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-fw78" class="veto"><div data-hf-id="hf-4mlr" class="veto-num">24h</div><div data-hf-id="hf-x11t"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-i83p">Optional rejection stage</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-z3p7"><strong data-hf-id="hf-67ur">≥90%</strong> of frozen eligible rejection power</p><p data-hf-id="hf-jomg" class="muted">Funds stay held until required periods finish.</p></div></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-d8cp" class="finance">Intended escrow model · Live payments not enabled</div></div></section>
<section data-hf-id="hf-dfac" id="scene-10" class="clip" data-start="217.584" data-duration="24.952" data-track-index="10"><div data-hf-id="hf-4rod" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-df6x" class="kicker">10 / Settlement and records</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-v8dd" class="title">Release, or return to the source.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-ym4y" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-gp65" class="settle"><div data-hf-id="hf-0sfv" class="pool"><strong data-hf-id="hf-wfdp">Held funds</strong><span data-hf-id="hf-9ooh">Intended escrow design</span></div><div data-hf-id="hf-oiva" class="settle-paths"><div data-hf-id="hf-7owz" class="box cyanbox"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-g1ml">Accepted outcome</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-agb5">Release to winning schemes.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-3mx0" class="box"><h3 data-hf-id="hf-mj5o">Rejected or cancelled</h3><p data-hf-id="hf-5658">Refund original contributors.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-tsv3" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-ggi7" class="record"><div data-hf-id="hf-u9r0" class="record-row"><span data-hf-id="hf-gjc9">DEPOSIT</span><strong data-hf-id="hf-3esm">Original source</strong></div><div data-hf-id="hf-hbkk" class="record-row"><span data-hf-id="hf-yyr6">TRANSFER</span><strong data-hf-id="hf-3bxh">Winning scheme</strong></div><div data-hf-id="hf-g4nh" class="record-row"><span data-hf-id="hf-s7oz">REFUND</span><strong data-hf-id="hf-e3mw">Original contributor</strong></div></div><p data-hf-id="hf-hbpg" class="note">External attestations are independently unverified. A record is not proof of a Fundicate transfer.</p></div><div data-hf-id="hf-ef9s" class="finance">Intended escrow model · Live payments not enabled</div></div></section>
<section data-hf-id="hf-wd5z" id="scene-11" class="clip" data-start="242.536" data-duration="33.095" data-track-index="11"><div data-hf-id="hf-55ze" class="chapter"><div data-hf-id="hf-rh5e" class="kicker">The complete workflow</div><h1 data-hf-id="hf-dno5" class="title">Fund together. Decide together.</h1><div data-hf-id="hf-y7tx" class="staged stage-a"><div data-hf-id="hf-ck2w" class="flow"><div data-hf-id="hf-a43z" class="flow-step"><span data-hf-id="hf-yqzu" class="step-no">01</span><h3 data-hf-id="hf-hr3e">Create syndicate</h3></div><div data-hf-id="hf-llyn" class="flow-step"><span data-hf-id="hf-z5av" class="step-no">02</span><h3 data-hf-id="hf-c4ys">Set agenda</h3></div><div data-hf-id="hf-l7nm" class="flow-step"><span data-hf-id="hf-zjlw" class="step-no">03</span><h3 data-hf-id="hf-semy">Approve members</h3></div><div data-hf-id="hf-ktcl" class="flow-step"><span data-hf-id="hf-zxwx" class="step-no">04</span><h3 data-hf-id="hf-qx2x">Collect contributions</h3></div><div data-hf-id="hf-nlhs" class="flow-step"><span data-hf-id="hf-0c7y" class="step-no">05</span><h3 data-hf-id="hf-uq0c">Screen schemes</h3></div><div data-hf-id="hf-n76r" class="flow-step"><span data-hf-id="hf-0qiz" class="step-no">06</span><h3 data-hf-id="hf-lwo7">Elect winners</h3></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-8zwg" class="end-flow"><span data-hf-id="hf-pid5" class="pill">Rejection stage</span><span data-hf-id="hf-6ax6" class="pill">Settle or refund</span><span data-hf-id="hf-dbpp" class="pill">Review outcomes</span></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-u764" class="staged stage-b"><div data-hf-id="hf-zt4l" class="closing"><div data-hf-id="hf-50iu" class="wordmark"><span data-hf-id="hf-zeo6" class="mark"><i data-hf-id="hf-wt6k"></i><i data-hf-id="hf-zeb8"></i><i data-hf-id="hf-y7e5"></i><i data-hf-id="hf-ylp6"></i></span>fundicate.</div><h2 data-hf-id="hf-79kg">Fund together. Decide together.</h2><p data-hf-id="hf-ncnv">Managers organize. Members decide.</p><div data-hf-id="hf-4d81" class="closing-finance">An independent escrow system is intended to control the money.</div><div data-hf-id="hf-jgs1" class="closing-status">Wallet login available locally · Live payment verification remains separate</div></div></div><div data-hf-id="hf-4jhd" class="demo">Illustrative demo</div></div></section>
